# Packages qdistro builds and tests install from the pinned Tumbleweed
# history repos: `<repo> <name>.<arch>`, one per line, sorted. Recorded from
# what consumers actually fetched through the qd_serve repo-cache proxy
# (`scripts/vm/qd-cache-warm --record` after an online run); qd-cache-warm
# prefetches exactly this set and `--check` audits it for QCI_OFFLINE runs.
